# v0.32 §17-8 — observability output, never fixture INPUT.
# `_orient_log` appends a line every time `orient` or `progress-card` runs, into the same
# directory as the thing it observed. Six of these got committed, so every suite run modified
# six TRACKED files and "is the tree clean?" stopped being a usable signal. Two had already
# reached the 500-line rotation cap inside the repository. Nothing reads them (0 references in
# the suites, the hooks or orient-audit.py) — they are residue, not inputs.
plugins/compass/scripts/fixtures/**/orient.log
